SUMMARY:Kusama Inspired Ceramic Pumpkin
LOCATION:Rockdale Art Center\, 799 Mount Rd\, Aston\, PA
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of mesmerizing patterns and avant-garde style
 ! In this sophisticated yet accessible evening workshop\, adults will hand
 -sculpt a stunning\, Yayoi Kusama-inspired ceramic pumpkin.\n\nGuided step
 -by-step\, you will learn how to mold and shape a dynamic\, ribbed clay pu
 mpkin form. From there\, we will channel the iconic look of the famous con
 temporary artist by utilizing bold\, high-contrast colors and meticulous\,
  hypnotic polka-dot detailing.\n\nMore Information\n\nListing: https://del
 coarts.org/event/kusama-inspired-ceramic-pumpkin/
URL:https://delcoarts.org/event/kusama-inspired-ceramic-pumpkin/
